# Ignore all `resources/` contents (vendored binaries: demucs.exe, GGML
# model, etc.) — but exempt the per-instrument design-asset directory
# used by the Showroom. Use `resources/*` (not `resources/`) so git
# can re-include the exempt path; ignoring the directory itself blocks
# any nested re-includes.
resources/*
!resources/instruments/
!resources/instruments/**
resources/instruments/*/source-*
